    "summary": "A man&#039;s fur coat; mid-brown, flared in shape with long sleeves.  Made from many pieces of reindeer (?) fur. Rounded stand-up collar with fur on inside and out.  Tongue-shaped flap stitched centre front.  Length of commercial red wool tabby cloth sewn around collar extending to two flaps over chest.  (Centre decorated with single line of blue machine stitching framed by yellow line.)  Red and yellow wool braid with red wool tassel on end stitched either side of neck opening.  Separate paler, cream fur at cuff. Strip of red wool cloth stitched into front shoulder seams.  Good condition.",
